The MIT licence above covers the source code of this project.

It does not cover the merit badge requirement text, which belongs to Scouting
America. That text is reproduced here for the convenience of Scouts and
counselors — in `mbworkbook/data/requirements.json`, and in the files this
program generates. The official, current requirements are the ones published
at scouting.org and in the current merit badge pamphlet.

"Scouting America", "Boy Scouts of America", "Eagle Scout" and the merit badge
names are marks of Scouting America. This project is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Scouting America.
